  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Let a vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> be in the plane containing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is perpendicular to the vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and its projection on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>19</mn></math> units, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to _____."
  },
